  "alumniHtml": "<p style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Alumni</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px\"><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Cody Chun</span>, ND undergraduate</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Eric Durazno</span>, ND undergraduate</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:22px\"></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"font-size:22px\">Qingyu Fang</span></span><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:22px\">, iSURE, next stop UW HCDE</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Jingyi Liu</span>, iSURE, next stop Xi'an Jiaotong University</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Zilang Cheng</span>, iSURE, next stop UPenn</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Linrui Shou</span>, iSURE, next stop CMU</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Zhechen (Leon) Zhao</span>, </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Research assistant,</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:22px\"> next stop UChicago</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px\"><span styl